---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Start a Website Project | Brighter Sites"
  description="Start a conversation with Brighter Sites about a custom website for your therapy, coaching, or wellness practice, or request a free 15-minute website consultation."
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Start a project</p>
      <h1>Tell us what you want your website to become.</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        Whether you are opening a new practice or replacing an existing site, the first step is simply a conversation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container contact-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
        <h2>Start with a simple introduction.</h2>
        <p>
          Tell us about your practice, where you are located, and what you would like your website to accomplish.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-card" id="consultation">
        <p>Free 15-minute website consultation</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top:.45rem">Talk through your website before you decide.</h3>

        <div style="margin-top:.85rem; color:var(--body); line-height:1.7">
          Not sure what your practice needs or whether Brighter Sites is the right fit?
          Request a free 15-minute online consultation to talk through your current
          website, what you are looking for, and any questions about getting started.
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:.8rem; color:var(--body); line-height:1.7">
          Consultations are held online through Google Meet. No phone number is
          required and there is no pressure or obligation.
        </div>

        <a
          class="button"
          href="mailto:help@brightersites.app?subject=Free%2015-Minute%20Website%20Consultation&body=Name%3A%0D%0APractice%20or%20business%20name%3A%0D%0AWebsite%20URL%20(if%20you%20have%20one)%3A%0D%0AWhat%20would%20you%20like%20to%20discuss%3F%3A%0D%0A"
        >
          Request a free 15-minute consultation
        </a>

        <div style="margin:1.6rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line)"></div>

        <p>Email</p>
        <a href="mailto:help@brightersites.app">
          help@brightersites.app
        </a>

        <div style="margin-top:1rem; color:var(--body); line-height:1.7">
          Prefer email? Send a short introduction with your practice name,
          location, and what you are hoping to improve or build. We will reply
          with the next steps and any questions needed to understand the project.
        </div>

        <a class="button secondary" href="mailto:help@brightersites.app">
          Start a conversation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
